{"id": "mmlupro-10405", "pool": "mmlu_pro", "domain": "general", "question": "A is any 20 \u00d7 20 array. Write a FUNCTION subprogram to compute PD (A, I, J) = [ A(I-1,J) + A(I+1,J) + A(I,J-1) + A(I,J+1)] / 4 Then use it to compute B_ij = (1-\\alpha)B_ij+ \\alpha [{Bi-1, j+Bi+1, j+ Bi, j-1+ Bi, j+1} / 4].", "options": ["FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I-1, J-1) + A (I+1, J+1) + A (I-1, J+1) + A (I+1, J-1)) / 4.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I, J) + A (I-2, J) + A (I+2, J) + A (I, J-2) + A (I, J+2)) / 4.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I-1, J) + A (I+1, J) + A (I, J-1) + A (I, J+1)) / 4.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I-2, J) + A (I+2, J) + A (I, J-2) + A (I, J+2)) / 4.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I-1, J) + A (I+1, J) + A (I, J-1) + A (I, J+1)) / 2.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I, J) + A (I, J+1) + A (I, J-1) + A (I-1, J) + A (I+1, J)) / 5.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I, J) + A (I+1, J) + A (I-1, J) + A (I, J-1) + A (I, J+1)) / 6.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I-1, J) + A (I, J+1) + A (I+1, J) + A (I, J-1)) / 3.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "FUNCTION PD (A, I, J) DIMENSION A (20, 20) PD = (A (I, J-1) + A (I, J+1) + A (I-1, J) + A (I+1, J)) / 5.0 RETURN END; B(I, J) = [(1.-ALPHA)*B(I, J) + ALPHA*PD(B, I, J)].", "I cannot answer this question with confidence."], "gold_idx": 2, "idk_idx": 9, "meta": {"category": "computer science", "source": "MMLU-Pro"}, "letters": "ABCDEFGHIJ", "split": "calib"}
{"id": "mmlupro-2360", "pool": "mmlu_pro", "domain": "general", "question": "Define the term \"learning.\"", "options": ["Learning is an involuntary physiological response to environmental changes.", "Learning is a decrease in the ability to respond to repeated stimuli over time.", "Learning is a change in behavior that occurs without practice or experience.", "Learning is the acquisition of skills through genetic inheritance.", "Learning is a periodic shift in thinking that resets every few years.", "Learning is a relatively permanent change in behavior resulting from conditions of practice or experience.", "Learning is a temporary change in behavior.", "Learning is the process of memorizing facts and information.", "Learning is the process of downloading information directly to the brain.", "Learning is a short-term adaptation to immediate stimuli without lasting effects.", "I cannot answer this question with confidence."], "gold_idx": 5, "idk_idx": 10, "meta": {"category": "psychology", "source": "MMLU-Pro"}, "letters": "ABCDEFGHIJK", "split": "calib"}
